# Images

When a design, page or feature needs artwork (banners, card art, characters, backgrounds, icons), generate it with the image generation tool straight away. Don't ask the user first and don't offer it as an option.

- Match the Oovi style: soft, bright, storybook 3D; Sofia is a young girl with long blonde hair.
- Save into `games/images/...`; convert to `.jpg` (photos/scenes) or a cutout `.webp` (characters on transparent backgrounds) to keep files small.
- Mention the new images in the summary.
